<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Seizure Prediction - Earbud EEG</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link
      href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Barlow+Condensed:wght@400;500;600&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&family=Roboto+Mono:wght@400&display=swap"
      rel="stylesheet"
    />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/theme.css" />
  </head>
  <body>
    <header class="topbar">
      <a class="brand" href="/dashboard" aria-label="Earbud EEG dashboard">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M12 0 L14 10 L24 12 L14 14 L12 24 L10 14 L0 12 L10 10 Z" fill="#ffffff" />
          <path d="M12 7 L13 11 L17 12 L13 13 L12 17 L11 13 L7 12 L11 11 Z" fill="#d9963f" />
        </svg>
        <b>EARBUD<span>&middot;</span>EEG</b>
      </a>
      <div class="topbar__right">
        <a class="btn" href="/dashboard">Dashboard</a>
        <a class="btn btn--primary" href="/waitlist?feature=analysis">Join analysis waitlist</a>
      </div>
    </header>

    <main class="shell">
      <section class="page-head">
        <p class="eyebrow">Hardware required</p>
        <h1>Seizure Prediction Is Blocked</h1>
        <p class="sub">Buy the Earbud EEG hardware first, then seizure prediction can be enabled.</p>
      </section>

      <div class="stack">
        <section class="panel">
          <p class="panel__eyebrow">Not available yet</p>
          <h2 class="panel__title">Join the prediction waitlist</h2>
          <p class="panel__desc">
            The EDF upload and CNN-GRU prediction flow are disabled for now because
            the product requires the Earbud EEG hardware workflow. Add yourself to
            the waitlist and we will keep your interest for seizure prediction access.
          </p>
          <div class="lock-note">Blocked until hardware purchase</div>
          <div class="btn-row" style="margin-top: 20px">
            <a href="/waitlist?feature=prediction" class="btn btn--primary">Join prediction waitlist</a>
            <a href="/dashboard" class="btn">Back to dashboard</a>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="panel">
          <p class="panel__eyebrow">What unlocks later</p>
          <h2 class="panel__title">Hardware-enabled workflow</h2>
          <ul class="plain-list">
            <li>Live earbud EEG collection after the hardware kit is connected.</li>
            <li>Signal processing, filtering, and report generation from real data.</li>
            <li>Seizure prediction access once the hardware workflow is available.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>
      </div>
    </main>

    <footer>EEG Analysis System</footer>
  </body>
</html>
